<title>USA: Koger Equity Inc Q4 drops from yr ago gain.</title>
<headline>Koger Equity Inc Q4 drops from yr ago gain.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In Thousands Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>		     For the Three Months Ended  For Year Ended</p>
<p>			 12/31/96   12/31/95   12/31/96    12/31/95</p>
<p> Rental revenues    $25,682    $23,366    $98,342     $94,865</p>
<p> Interest revenues	644	  310	1,951	14,440</p>
<p> Gain on TKPL note	313	5,300	  292	11,288</p>
<p> Total revenues	27,760     29,245    104,072     125,750</p>
<p> Net income	     3,010	5,777     10,501	28,990</p>
<p>Earnings per common share</p>
<p>  Primary		  0.14	 0.32	 0.54	  1.61</p>
<p>  Fully diluted	  0.14	 0.31	 0.54	  1.60</p>
<p>Weighted average shares</p>
<p>outstanding</p>
<p>  Primary		21,762     18,292     19,500	18,011</p>
<p>  Fully diluted	21,951     18,450     19,576	18,091</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 funds from operations: $9.48 million vs $5.79 million.</p>
<p>Year funds from operations: $33.2 million vs $36.7 million, which includes $13.1 million in revenues from TKPL mortgage notes.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
